"text": "For six hours?", "name": "DWAYNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a firm medium. It takes time.", "name": "WOMAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "He writes something.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Crosses it out.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What's your name?", "name": "DWAYNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Priya.", "name": "WOMAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Priya, my manager is going to be here at four.", "name": "DWAYNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then I have an hour.", "name": "PRIYA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "She rolls over.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Pulls a pillow to her face.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "The front door chimes.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "MS. LOCKHART, 50s, regional manager in a camel coat, enters with a travel mug.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "She sees the bed.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Sees Priya.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Sees Dwayne.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dwayne.", "name": "MS. LOCKHART", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's not what it looks like.", "name": "DWAYNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It looks like a customer is asleep.", "name": "MS. LOCKHART", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then it's exactly what it looks like.", "name": "DWAYNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Lockhart sips her coffee.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Sits on the next bed over.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Kicks off her heels.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Scoot.", "name": "MS. LOCKHART", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}